retrying is safe. Gateway can produce its own codes and bodies. Examine the actual body and persisted result."},"1125":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Symptom or message"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"What to check"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"curl rejects TLS, name or issuer"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"URL, clock, server SAN and approved root in `est-trust.pem`. Resolve trust in Deployment; do not skip verification."},"1129":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"404 or missing APS"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Public route `/.well-known/est/{DMS_ID}/{operation}` and existing DMS. APS is not the service name."},"1131":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"400, CSR or format error"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`Content-Type: application/pkcs10`, Base64 of DER, valid signature and a body preserved without double encoding."},"1133":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Missing credential or invalid certificate"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Operation mode, validating CA, dates, revocation and credential delivery by Gateway. Do not confuse server TLS trust with the bootstrap CA."},"1135":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Webhook denies, times out or responds without authorization"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Configuration, connectivity and JSON response with `authorized: true`. There is no automatic fallback to `NO_AUTH`."},"1137":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`unexpected status code: <n>: redirects are not followed`"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook answered with a redirect. Configure the final absolute `http` or `https` URL in the webhook config; redirects are never followed."},"1139":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`webhook response exceeds 1048576 bytes`"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The receiver returned more than 1 MiB of JSON. Reduce the response of the authorization webhook."},"1141":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`webhook config must not reference files`"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook config points to files (`ca_cert_file`, `mtls_options.cert_file`, `mtls_options.key_file`). For mTLS, enter the PEM as `cert_content` and `key_content`; remove any other file field, including `ca_cert_file`, which has no inline equivalent (the receiver certificate must chain to the system trust store). See the upgrade note in DMS."},"1143":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"400 `struct validation error` creating or updating a DMS"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook config of the operation that uses it is invalid. Review `external_webhook_settings` in DMS."},"1145":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"HTTP 500 with an `err` body on enroll or reenroll"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Service failures reach the EST client as 500 with a body of `err` plus the message; webhook authorization errors are named there."},"1147":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`device not preregistered`"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"PRE\\_REGISTRATION requires an existing inventory entry."},"1149":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`forbiddenNewEnrollment`"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-32","page_