y that covers this test and check the pair and chain."},"1452":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-bootstrap-credential","content":"The same root CA can issue it for this isolated evaluation. The operational identity will have a different key and certificate. The matching CN makes the example easier to read; initial certificate authentication does not itself bind the bootstrap CN to the requested ID. Review admission before applying the policy to a population."},"1453":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Create an explicit leaf profile compatible with EC P-256, with **Honor Subject**, CN from the CSR, **Digital Signature**, **Client Authentication** and **1 hour** validity within the root's validity. Do not enable CA signing. Rules and precedence are explained in Profiles."},"1454":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Create the `Acme EST Evaluation` DMS with this configuration:"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Setting"},"1456":{"id":"/docs