ate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: for example, one year from creation."},"2246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: for example, 90 days, within the CA's lifetime."},"2247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"The CA name becomes its `Common Name`. Keep the CA usages needed to sign certificates and CRLs."},"2248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#review-and-create-the-ca","content":"Check the engine, algorithm, subject, root type and dates. Confirm creation and note the authority identifier so you can recognize it in the DMS or API."},"2249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result","content":"Open the new CA. It should appear active, show its certificate and allow access to **Issued Certificates**."},"2250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/p