ster no pueda asociar."},"269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Primero decide si necesitas tres data planes independientes o solo tres nombres de host."},"270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Requisito"},"271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño recomendado"},"272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Consecuencia"},"273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Varias URL o servicios de Lamassu"},"274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Un Gateway con varias rutas"},"275":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/