entes"},"281":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Los clientes deben indicar puertos no estándar"},"282":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Terminación TLS/mTLS separada detrás de una IP"},"283":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Front door con enrutamiento SNI hacia Gateways internos"},"284":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño avanzado; el front door usa TLS passthrough y cada Gateway termina su propio TLS"},"285":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Recursos Gateway separados pero proxy compartido"},"286":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Modo merged Gateway de Envoy"},"287":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Solo separación lógica; cada listener necesita una tupla única de puerto, protocolo y hostname"},"288":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Tres Services `LoadBalancer` independientes no pueden reservar a la vez los mismos puertos 80 y 443 mediante K3s ServiceLB. Usa un Gateway compartido, asigna VIP distintas con otro balanceador o utiliza puertos diferentes."},"289":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Envoy Gateway provisiona normalmente un proxy fleet por `Gateway`. Su modo merged Gateway puede compartir un fleet y una dirección, pero no es un cambio directo para varias releases de Lamassu: los listeners generados usan los mismos puertos y protocolos sin hostnames distintos, por lo que entran en conflicto salvo que personalices el diseño."},"290":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Usa un front door con SNI solo cuando los Gateways internos deban mantener políticas TLS o mTLS independientes:"},"291":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Esto requiere hostnames SNI distintos y configuración de red externa al chart de Lamassu."},"292":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si un Gateway puede gestionar TLS y el enrutamiento, usa el valor predeterminado del chart."},"293":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los Gateways necesitan políticas independientes y puedes asignar IP, usa una VIP por Gateway."},"294":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si solo necesitas separar los recursos Kubernetes, evalúa merged Gateway y usa tuplas de listener únicas."},"295":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los data planes y la terminación TLS deben ser independientes detrás de una IP, añade un front door con TLS passthrough y SNI."},"296":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-39/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-61","page_id":"/d